  "description": "A human-in-the-loop approval middleware for Microsoft Agents AI pipelines. Provides a UseApprovalMiddleware extension on AIAgentBuilder to gate selected tool calls with a caller-supplied async callback. Pass only the tools that need approval — all other tools registered on the agent execute freely. The callback receives a FunctionCallContent and returns true to approve or false/null to deny; no framework-specific types are exposed to callers.",
